    "sub_name": "纖維複合材料產業趨勢(二)",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRY TRENDS OF THE FIBER COMPOSITE MATERIALS (2)",
    "describe_ch": "工業數位設計是一門幾何圖形表現與追求現代時尚感的主題式教學。本課程促使學生瞭解數位繪圖語言，並深入頗析數位圖形表達方式，讓學生在數位潮流的素養薰陶中，呈現出當代的工業設計美學和時尚感。",
    "describe_eh": "Let the freshman generally understand the related industries, the majors, and research developments of the department, it also provides the different science fields for engineering students with resources for understanding and addressing ethical problems. And, to strengthen the communication between the professor and freshmen, each professor takes turns teaching to expand their major field to students.",
